{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 16,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Great Apostasy"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the Spirit "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "explicitly"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "expressly says that in latter times some will depart from the faith, giving heed to deceiving spirits and doctrines of demons, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "speaking lies in hypocrisy, having their own conscience seared with a hot iron, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "forbidding to marry, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and commanding"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to abstain from foods which God created to be received with thanksgiving by those who believe and know the truth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For every creature of God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " good, and nothing is to be refused if it is received with thanksgiving; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for it is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "set apart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sanctified by the word of God and prayer."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Good Servant of Jesus Christ"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If you instruct the brethren in these things, you will be a good minister of Jesus Christ, nourished in the words of faith and of the good doctrine which you have carefully followed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But reject profane and old wives’ fables, and exercise yourself toward godliness. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For bodily exercise profits a little, but godliness is profitable for all things, having promise of the life that now is and of that which is to come. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a faithful saying and worthy of all acceptance. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For to this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "end"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU we labor and strive,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "we both labor and suffer reproach, because we trust in the living God, who is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Savior of all men, especially of those who believe. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These things command and teach."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Take Heed to Your Ministry"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let no one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "look down on your youthfulness"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "despise your youth, but be an example to the believers in word, in conduct, in love, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits in spirit"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in spirit, in faith, in purity. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Till I come, give attention to reading, to exhortation, to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "teaching"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "doctrine. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not neglect the gift that is in you, which was given to you by prophecy with the laying on of the hands of the eldership. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Meditate on these things; give yourself entirely to them, that your progress may be evident to all. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Take heed to yourself and to the doctrine. Continue in them, for in doing this you will save both yourself and those who hear you."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}